== Effects ==
* {{e|Mom}}'s leg starts stomping down repeatedly, targeting Isaac, for one minute.

== Notes ==
* This card's effect is nearly identical to {{i|Broken Shovel 1}}'s.

== Strategy ==
* If lacking bombs, II - The High Priestess? may be used to open secret rooms and destroy obstacles. It is however recommended to do so after a floor is cleared, as it can make dodging during combat more difficult.

== Interactions ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth}}: No effect.
* {{i|Broken Shovel 1}}: II - The High Priestess? does not stack with the Broken Shovel's effect. The stomp frequency remains the same.

